{
  "name": "Alert Slack and Telegram when a Preflight post fails",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Failed post → Slack and Telegram\n\nPreflight sends `post.failed` once it has stopped retrying a channel, so this fires once per real failure, not on every attempt. The alert says which network, why, whether a retry can work, and links straight to the post in Preflight.\n\nKeep the branch you use and delete the other.\n\n**Set up**: Preflight credential with webhooks:read and webhooks:write scopes, then activate. Preflight only delivers to a public https URL, so a local n8n needs a tunnel.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "a1de6b46-f1d7-518a-aca5-95ad9010915e",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "events": [
          "post.failed"
        ]
      },
      "id": "b7a3117a-18ab-5f2a-9fd2-70516a844cdc",
      "name": "When a post fails",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-preflight.preflightTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "8135b3eb-c8b8-5a9d-b2de-da056677928c"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "post",
        "operation": "get",
        "postId": "={{ $json.postId }}"
      },
      "id": "24ed70ec-8239-5a6b-a04e-1cebb95c64c0",
      "name": "Get the post",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-preflight.preflight",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "79599531-bef1-5be8-83b4-9852d4b44cd2",
              "name": "message",
              "value": "={{ '⚠️ Preflight: post failed on ' + $('When a post fails').item.json.platform + '\\n' + 'Why: ' + $('When a post fails').item.json.error + '\\n' + ($('When a post fails').item.json.permanent ? 'Retrying will not help until this is fixed.' : 'A retry may work.') + '\\n' + 'Text: ' + ($json.content || '').slice(0, 140) + '\\n' + 'Open: https://preflight.social/posts?post=' + $json.id }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "23b29c8e-3aec-5b7c-8601-ab8401a3b09f",
      "name": "Write alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "text": "={{ $json.message }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "77965d9c-3125-5f8a-816a-2c44a63c5beb",
      "name": "Send to Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        660,
        -100
      ],
      "webhookId": "5a131282-0d37-52de-b11a-e914f952de9f"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "",
        "text": "={{ $json.message }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "id": "9418e4ad-6984-51cb-b078-441120aa9f17",
      "name": "Send to Telegram",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        660,
        100
      ],
      "webhookId": "55348b54-50db-5cd5-ade6-9599c1944947"
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "When a post fails": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Get the post",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Get the post": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Write alert",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Write alert": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send to Slack",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "Send to Telegram",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "pinData": {},
